description_html:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;People arrive at our pages ready to change their health, and unsure whether to begin. Starting a treatment that could change your life is a big decision, and often a frightening one. Your job is to help them take the first step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Senior Product Designer role for someone who can make that moment clear, credible and human. You design the surfaces where people decide to start, some of the highest-stakes creative work we have, and you can measure your impact in the number of people who begin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design every page as an argument. Every element earns its place: the problem, the solution, the proof, the process, the value, and the blockers you remove.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our highest-leverage acquisition surfaces end to end: landing pages, the signature conversion components on them, and the templates they sit in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the conversion-bearing pieces others don&#39;t, e.g. BMI calculators and the interstitial moments that carry someone through a clinical quiz and consult form, the points where people hesitate and leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the case on every surface. Meet someone where they are in their decision and build a clear, structured argument for why to start, built around them, not a list of features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate clinical language into words a patient understands and trusts. Accurate, compliant and human at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design dense information like an infographic: communicate a lot, simply. Data visualisation and strong hierarchy in place of walls of text, without losing the detail. Our patients care about the detail, so your job is to convey it clearly, not to oversimplify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean on interaction design to carry the detail. Progressive disclosure, reveals and interactive data let people go as deep as they want, without meeting it all at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use motion and pacing with intent. You control the rhythm of a page and the beat between steps, so people keep moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry the creative set from our adverts through to the landing page and the touchpoints after it. One unbroken story from ad to conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner your CRO manager on the optimisation loop. You bring the hypothesis and the design, shape the tests and read what comes back, and turn the result into the next move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help more people start. That is the number you move, and you always know why it moved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn trust with evidence: multiple, specific proof points, not a logo and a star rating, all holding up in a regulated market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What good looks like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scope:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you own the front door. The acquisition surfaces where people decide whether to begin, and the design-led testing that keeps them improving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you help more people get started. At our scale that reaches into millions of lives, real people beginning a treatment that changes theirs. You move that number, and you can show the before and after.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Influence:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you work alongside growth experts, CROs, and product and commercial partners. You hold the bar on what is right for the patient, balancing it against the needs of the business. You bring people with you by offering options and choices, gaining buy-in with evidence rather than force. And you raise the bar inside the design team too, giving sharp critique and making the designers around you better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About you (who you are)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best person for this role has a rare mix. You make dense, complex medical information simple and clear, without dumbing it down or losing what matters. You are doing this for people at a vulnerable moment, so empathy and emotional intelligence are critical. You read the emotion in a health decision and meet people where they are, with warmth and without judgement. And you are deeply curious about health. You do not need to arrive knowing the conditions we treat, only the drive to understand them. You pair all of that with sharp acquisition craft and the discipline to test. You hold the human and the commercial in the same hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Problem definition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You shape the problem, not just the pixels. You use data and research to work out which surface matters most and which experiment is worth running, then package it into something the team can build. The signal is evidence you helped define the right test, not just made the variant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Visual craft.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Non-negotiable. Typography, spacing, colour, motion and micro-interactions, used with intent, not decoration. This role also carries the interstitial illustration in the quiz and consult flow, so you make that visual work yourself. Weak craft is a no, whatever the conversion talk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Accessibility.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You design inclusively without being asked. You know why the standard exists, not just what it says, and it shows in judgement calls a checklist cannot make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Systems thinking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You think in modules, not single pages. You compose from the design system&#39;s primitives, own the signature, conversion-bearing components built on top, and build page templates that assemble in different ways to serve different needs. Modularity is your default and it keeps you fast, but you build bespoke, ground-up pages when a high-profile moment deserves the craft. You extend the system rather than reinvent it, and you keep a clean line between the atomic layer the system owns and the bespoke pieces you own. Infrastructure compounds. Single screens do not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product and commercial sense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You reason in conversion rate, cost per acquisition and funnel drop-off. You know which page matters most to the business and why, and you defend a design decision in the language of the metric it moves. Craft in isolation moves nothing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Clear, specific, opinionated. You say what you decided and why, and you are just as clear on what you chose not to do and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Working in the open.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You share early and often, and you use critique to sharpen the work. You lift the quality of every review you join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How you work with AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLMs are already embedded in your workflow. You use them to widen the range of variants you can test and to tighten the build-measure-learn loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prototype in tools like Claude Code and Cursor to test ideas in real code, not just mock them up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The signal is workflow, not tool count. Judgement spent where it counts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The full stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We expect you to work end to end, from problem definition and research to information architecture and UX writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation and experimentation is the core of the role. You design A/B tests, size them, and read them honestly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your own research and usability testing, feeding the next experiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copywriting and UX writing. You write the words that persuade and the words that guide, and both hold up in a regulated market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Composition from the design system, and ownership of the signature components and templates built on top of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Show us work where you took something complex and made it land. A page that told a clear story, held the detail without overwhelming, and helped a real person make a decision. We want the craft on the surface, the words weighted as heavily as the graphics, and evidence you designed with empathy for people at a moment that mattered. Show the outcome too: the number you moved and the testing that got you there. Applications without a portfolio will not be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typically 5 to 8 years in product design, with a track record of conversion-focused design and A/B testing on acquisition surfaces.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Patient-first mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You put patient outcomes first. Every decision weighs commercial growth against clinical safety and care, and you don&#39;t let one erode the other. You understand real health journeys well enough to make them simple, accessible and worth trusting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative creation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You work well across product, engineering and clinical, and you know a good idea can come from any of them. You listen to feedback and take it on, using it to make the work better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Curiosity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You ask why before how. You stay curious about the patient, the problem and the tools you use to solve it, and you&#39;re comfortable being a beginner when something new is worth learning.&lt;br&gt;Typically 5 to 8 years in product design, with a track record of conversion-focused design and A/B testing on acquisition surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, and skincare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be an owner&lt;/strong&gt; – Your own stake in the business with our employee options program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

