&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re pioneering a new role focused exclusively on quality assurance for GenAI/Agentic systems. As our Senior SDET for AI, you&#39;ll develop testing strategies, evaluation frameworks, and quality metrics specifically designed for LLM-powered applications. This role requires a unique blend of QA expertise, understanding of GenAI behaviour, and automation skills to ensure our AI features are reliable, accurate, and trustworthy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Design and architect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;174&quot;&gt; comprehensive test plans, evaluation frameworks, and quality metrics designed specifically for LLM-powered applications and agentic workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;321&quot;&gt;Develop robust, end-to-end automated test suites&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;371&quot;&gt; in Python across evaluations, API checks, UI checks, and performance tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;451&quot;&gt;Create automated prompt testing systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;492&quot;&gt; and regression suites to proactively detect unintended changes in model behaviour.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;579&quot;&gt;Establish multi-dimensional evaluation criteria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;628&quot;&gt; to measure and track GenAI quality across accuracy, relevance, safety, consistency, and latency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;729&quot;&gt;Perform adversarial testing (red-teaming)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;772&quot;&gt; to identify and mitigate model hallucinations, biases, or security vulnerabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;860&quot;&gt;Develop internal tools and testing frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;907&quot;&gt; that enable software engineering teams to seamlessly validate their own GenAI implementations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Deploy real-time monitoring and alerting systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1056&quot;&gt; to quickly detect and flag quality degradation of AI features in production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1137&quot;&gt;Own the overall quality and testing strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1183&quot;&gt; for your workstream, maintaining high-fidelity test datasets (&quot;golden examples&quot;) and defining QA best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2692&quot;&gt;Your Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2808&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of GenAI technologies including LLMs, prompt engineering, and AI application patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2916&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on Python coding experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2973&quot;&gt;Expert experience with test automation frameworks and scripting (Python, JavaScript, Selenium, Pytest).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3079&quot;&gt;Strong background of software testing methodologies (functional, integration, regression, performance, security testing).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;Proven ability to design test cases and evaluation criteria for non-deterministic systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3286&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with attention to detail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3359&quot;&gt;Experience with API testing tools (Postman, REST Assured) and backend testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3440&quot;&gt;Strong experience with CI/CD pipelines and automated testing integration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
