  The Integrated Campaigns and Programs Manager – EMEA at Extreme Networks will play a pivotal role in driving pipeline growth across the region. This role is responsible for the planning and execution of integrated marketing programs that span digital campaigns, ABM, virtual events, and EMEA lighthouse initiatives such as executive programs and flagship regional activations. The successful candidate will act as a bridge between global campaign strategy and regional execution, working closely with sales, marketing, and cross-functional teams to deliver high-impact programs for priority accounts and target segments.  
